<p style="text-align: center;"><img src="/images/2014/Innisfree.jpg" alt="A plein air painting of a tree in a field" width="500" height="394" /></p>
<p style="text-align: center;">Innisfree Farm. 9x12 oil on linen. 2014</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">I spent this morning standing in the middle of a field at Innisfree Farm in Marshall, VA. &nbsp;It started out quite cloudy and overcast but by the time I was half-way through the painting the sun had come out. &nbsp;I laid this one down fairly quickly and did a few small tweaks to the edges back in the studio.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">I've had a fairly good run of luck with plein air painting so far this year, managing to finish and keep a painting from 4 of the last 5 outings (a personal best).</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">This painting will be for sale at stop #4 on the WLAST tour.</p>